# Build context: repository root
# The agents image builds from the repo root so it can bundle the layout contract schemas from src/common.
# Ignore everything, then include only what the image needs.
*

!src/AI/assistant
!src/common/ts/layout-contract/schemas/json/layout
!src/common/ts/layout-contract/schemas/json/text-resources

# Heavy or irrelevant paths inside the included dirs.
**/bin
**/obj
**/.venv
**/.ci-venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/node_modules
